WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.469
Your last backflow test shouldn't start a second shift.

00:00:05.600 --> 00:00:09.410
After a day in the field, there are still forms to fill,

00:00:09.411 --> 00:00:12.931
reports to submit, and invoices to organize.

00:00:14.800 --> 00:00:19.365
StrataWorks Backflow Operations keeps your customers, assemblies,

00:00:19.366 --> 00:00:23.155
and test results connected, from the field to the office.

00:00:24.100 --> 00:00:28.375
Record your readings, then use them to fill your configured report.

00:00:28.376 --> 00:00:33.033
Review the completed form without copying the same information again.

00:00:38.200 --> 00:00:41.092
We fill the report and submit it for you.

00:00:41.093 --> 00:00:46.056
Approved reports are sent through your configured email submission workflow.

00:00:46.600 --> 00:00:49.946
Keep scheduling, reports, and invoicing together,

00:00:49.947 --> 00:00:53.203
so your team can see what needs attention next.

00:00:55.000 --> 00:01:00.153
Built for teams nationwide, add your municipalities and custom forms.

00:01:00.154 --> 00:01:05.143
Configure each form and confirm the authority's submission requirements.

00:01:05.700 --> 00:01:09.660
Spend less of your evening catching up on backflow paperwork.

00:01:11.300 --> 00:01:14.278
Get started for three hundred dollars per month,

00:01:14.279 --> 00:01:17.843
with setup assistance and up to five staff logins.

